<title>POLAND: Polish broad money up 1.4 pct June 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish broad money up 1.4 pct June 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's broad money rose by 2.104 billion zlotys, or 1.4 percent, in the period June 1-10 to 150.368 billion after a 2.4 pct rise in May, preliminary central bank figures showed on Thursday.</p>
</text>
